<heading>delete - Delete a topic.</heading>

<rule/>

<heading level="2">
Usage
</heading>

<pre>
  delete TOPIC
</pre>

<heading level="2">
Description
</heading>

<paragraph>
Deletes a topic. TOPIC may be an id or a topic name; if the
name is ambiguous, the matching topics and their categories
are shown and an id must be used. A topic that still contains
runs cannot be deleted.
</paragraph>

<heading level="2">
Examples
</heading>

<pre>
delete "Roman Empire"
  Delete the topic Roman Empire.
</pre>

<heading level="2">
See also
</heading>

<paragraph>
add, edit, list, find
</paragraph>
